{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00014",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.62,
      "end_seconds": 2.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Good afternoon. Take a seat, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.49,
      "end_seconds": 5.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.04,
      "end_seconds": 7.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Weather's turned, hasn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.64,
      "end_seconds": 12.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "It, It has. I got caught in the rain walking over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.74,
      "end_seconds": 15.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.22,
      "end_seconds": 26.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a dry cough that won't go away. It's getting on my nerves now. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.08,
      "end_seconds": 30.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "So, is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.53,
      "end_seconds": 39.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "Hmm, um, it's been about a month now. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.38,
      "end_seconds": 48.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.31,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.1,
      "end_seconds": 64.57,
      "duration_seconds": 15.47,
      "text": "Lying down and after meals definitely sets it off. I'd say all the time. Only sipping water, and it's not much. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.88,
      "end_seconds": 69.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.81,
      "end_seconds": 83.33,
      "duration_seconds": 13.52,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.89,
      "end_seconds": 86.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Has there been any shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.77,
      "end_seconds": 89.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "No. No shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.68,
      "end_seconds": 94.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.32,
      "end_seconds": 99.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.74,
      "end_seconds": 102.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.53,
      "end_seconds": 105.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Yeah, of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.12,
      "end_seconds": 118.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.34,
      "end_seconds": 121.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "My mother had high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.79,
      "end_seconds": 125.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.55,
      "end_seconds": 127.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.88,
      "end_seconds": 138.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.59,
      "end_seconds": 141.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.13,
      "end_seconds": 145.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.12,
      "end_seconds": 148.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.43,
      "end_seconds": 151.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.84,
      "end_seconds": 163.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "Digene, after meals. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.26,
      "end_seconds": 167.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.77,
      "end_seconds": 170.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.08,
      "end_seconds": 174.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.92,
      "end_seconds": 176.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.01,
      "end_seconds": 180.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Okay, now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.99,
      "end_seconds": 195.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Chest is clear and the throat looks a little red at the back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.17,
      "end_seconds": 223.32,
      "duration_seconds": 23.15,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with a cough driven by acid reflux at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.96,
      "end_seconds": 226.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.26,
      "end_seconds": 246.19,
      "duration_seconds": 16.93,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a cough driven by acid reflux, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a dry cough that won't go away for about a month, and no shortness of breath or night sweats."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.1,
      "end_seconds": 248.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.62,
      "end_seconds": 275.62,
      "duration_seconds": 26.0,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange breathing tests for chronic cough. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'll start you on pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast, for four weeks. That's for reflux. Don't eat for two or three hours before lying down, and raise the head of the bed a little. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.93,
      "end_seconds": 285.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.02,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.26,
      "end_seconds": 290.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.76,
      "end_seconds": 297.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.35,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "So, I take the pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast and come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.46,
      "end_seconds": 311.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. All right, I'll let you go. Any final questions first?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.81,
      "end_seconds": 316.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Uh, nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}